$MDESC::Creator = "EEPROM";
$MDESC::Type = "Football Extreme";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Football" @
         "\n<f1>Stadium: <f0> Shooters" @
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Description:\n<f0>Yes, once again our most favorite map ever has been made into a stadium map for the Football Mod. A long narrow section of jump pads and ramp that will shoot you up the the goal. Blocking is a must in this match. Each team will start infront of the other teams goal. Your team must take the ball back down to your goal and then run the shooter toward the enemy's goal to score. 40 points wins the game."@
         "\n\n<jc><f1>**<f0>Map engineered and designed by:<f1>**\n<f2>EEPROM (Mappers Extreme)\n\n\n<f0>Completed 10/18/00\n<f0>Revised 10/20/00";

